    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ghoorjooda aba nyoota mureeda",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 20:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghwalamda NG'UTAMIIDA ak gwayeesha Musa, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.20.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.20.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 20:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Eeshiina fuga Israeli, siida wassean aba jeeda fuga Israeli, ghana ea rabascheanda mida jeeda ng'eanyiida Israeli gil, adaw jeabwagi wassean aba jeeda diibigaaschi ak ghoadaw Moleki gajeabwar ghami; gaygafuta fuga bea ng'eanyiida lagheanga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.20.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.20.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 20:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak aniini gaydeafuursa bwadaw siidida, ak gaydasach siisi aba jeeda fugaaschi, aba gideaba niidaw jeabwagi aba jeeda diibigaaschi Moleki ak ghabwara ririnnyeanda heeda ghaydit iteanyu nea ghabwara ririnnyeanda gheawungeasu ghaydit. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.20.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.20.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 20:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea fuga bea ng'eanyiida iyaluulan gheanyanga nyaawa aba gida wassean aba heedeaba siidida, iyadaw Moleki jeabwagi aba jeeda diibigaaschi, ak ea manuusa siidida, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.20.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.20.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 20:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "abeeda gaydeafuursa badaydeanyu siidida sea fugeaba gheanyi, ak gaygooheeli fiisu sea fugaaschi, niny sea fuga aat geeshtaanyi ak gwahiseada sea Moleki.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.20.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.20.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 20:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.20.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.20.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 20:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Nea siida iiyamsa geaw fuga ascheeng'u ng'eanyiida ea beeneediga, ak gwahiseada sea saawa, gaydeafuursa siisi badaydeanyu, ak gaydasach aba jeeda fugaaschi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.20.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.20.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 20:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asi oamiini geat, ak ghoahuuyi ghaydidi; aba gideaba aniini geawooschi NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETEANG'WA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.20.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.20.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 20:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oang'waanya deaweedajeegeasu, nea goosinyi; aniini geawooschi NG'UTAMIIDA amiineegwa agooga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.20.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.20.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 20:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba gideaba siida mwaashta ghwaan ghana ghaamwat gajeenuus; aba gideaba ghamwaashta ghwaan ghana ghaamwat, foojeandaanyi gaygwanda badaydaanyi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.20.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.20.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 20:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.20.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.20.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 20:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Nea siida iimealuul sea gatmooda giischeewoocheandaanyi, duwaawi siida mealuul sea gatmooda mealuuluudayi gajeabwar gameewa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.20.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.20.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 20:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Siida iluudayi sea gatmooda ghwaan nijeasa ghwaan ak ghwadaah dawiishnataanyi; fiisu duwaawiin gajeabwar gameewa, nea foojeanda nyaawa gaygwanda badahuuka nyaawa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.20.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.20.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 20:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea siida iluudayi sea gatmooda orjeedaanyi, fiisu duwaawiin gajeabwar gameewa; aba gideaba nisin ng'asheanda muy, foojeanyeeka nyaawa gaygoobiida badahuuka nyaawa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.20.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.20.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 20:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea siida iluudayi sea ng'eedeeda gawuurji gil iluudayi gatmooda, fiisu duwaawiin gwasin gidamuy; gajeabwar gameewa, foojeanda nyaawa gaygwanda badahuuka nyaawa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.20.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.20.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 20:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea siida iigheah huda sea ghaamwat, eamuy; gajeaghwarda aba beasta niny ea saawa, ak abeeda ea manda munyinda jeedeang'wa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.20.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.20.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 20:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea siida iluudayi sea diyeayda, gajeabwar ghami; ak gajanuusa diyeayda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.20.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.20.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 20:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea gatmooda iineekiisa diyeayda ak gwaluudayi, gajanuusa gatmooda ea diyeayda; gajeabwar gameewa, nea foojeanda nyaawa gaygwanda badahuuka nyaawa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.20.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.20.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 20:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.20.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.20.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 20:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Nea siida iigheah huda ghaamwat, huda bea ghwaanagi ghana ea huda ghaamwat gil, ak ghwadaah dawiishnataanyi, nea ghwadaah niny dawiishnataang'u, nih ng'asheanda baspaseega, fiisu gajeasach aba madeeda seaygeadaanyi; nijaat dawiishnata huda ghaamwat, gayghwanyas ng'asheega munyas. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.20.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.20.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 20:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea siida iluudayi sea gatmooda neaweesa eaghwada, ak ghwadaah dawiishnataanyi, ak ea nijaat giireemda foojeandaanyi; gajeasach duwaawi aba jeeda fuga nyaawa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.20.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.20.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 20:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Adiidu gijaadi dawiishnata huda ghamageamadu ghana dea huda ghamagweanu, aba gideaba ghwajaat dawiishnata buweacheanda neeki; gayghwanyas ng'asheega nyaawa munyas. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.20.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.20.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 20:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea siida iluudayi gatmooda orjeeda ghamaghaamwat, nijaat dawiishnata orjeeda ghamaghaamwat; gayghwasar riing'eeda nyaawa, gaygameewa nea mwanyasa diibiga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.20.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.20.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 20:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea siida iigheah gatmooda orjeeda ghaamwat, nih ririnnyeanda gil; nijaat dawiishnata orjeeda ghaamwat, fiisu mayghwanyas diibiga.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.20.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.20.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 20:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.20.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.20.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 20:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ak gajeang'waanya deaweedajeegeasu sean ea diigheanyeekeasu sean, ak goosinyi; aba gideaba ng'eanyiini eeyeaneegwa oopiidanean ea mwaaheawaneegwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.20.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.20.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 20:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ea majoopiidana jeeda searoojiga eemeeda mida madeedeang'wa; aba gideaba nisin ng'asheesu seaniin, ak ghoah gida aasiti ng'asheesu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.20.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.20.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 20:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ghoah gideayeeshiinaneegwa, ‘Gajahearana ng'eanyiida nyaawa, ak gaydagooneegwa ghoah deang'wa, was ng'eanyiida gulda eanooga ea maleeda.’ Aniini geawooschi NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETEANG'WA, ghayi aheeleeweey fugaagu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.20.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.20.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 20:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gooheeli diyeayda miy ea dea miimiy, nea gooheeli dariideanda muy ea dea miy; adoabwari geat ririnnyeanda aba diyeayda ghana dariideanda ghana gida wassean badiina ng'eanyi, ghayi asajaneegwa aba gideaba mii miyaas. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.20.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.20.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 20:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gajawoosa ghaydit aba heedeanyu; aba gideaba aniini NG'UTAMIIDA geawooschi ghaydit, ak ea neaheeleewaneegwa fugeagwa, aba gideaba gajawoosa fugeasu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.20.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.20.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
